<title>USA: Pamet Systems names McKay president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Pamet Systems names McKay president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ACTON, Mass. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pamet Systems Inc said Friday that David McKay has been named president and chief executive of the company.</p>
<p>Pamet said Joel Searcy, its founder, former president and CEO, will remain with the company as chief technology officer and board chairman.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Pamet, McKay was global systems manager for Mobil Corp unit Mobil Oil, of Fairfax, Va.</p>
